---
import PixelIcon from './PixelIcon.astro';
import { companions } from '../data/companions';
---

<section class="section companions" id="companions" aria-labelledby="companions-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-num">03</span> TAVERN COMPANIONS</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="companions-title">酒馆伙伴<span class="section-title__en">PARTY MEMBERS</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">两位常驻伙伴的座位已经留好了。正式立绘到位前，先放同款占位卡，不擅自决定长相。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="companion-grid">
      {companions.map((c) => (
        <article
          class:list={['companion-card', `accent-${c.accent}`]}
          data-companion
          data-lines={JSON.stringify(c.lines)}
          data-reveal
          role="button"
          tabindex="0"
          aria-label={`和 ${c.name} 说句话，点击切换台词`}
        >
          <div class="companion-card__art">
            {c.art ? (
              <img src={c.art} alt={`${c.name} 的正式立绘`} loading="lazy" width="320" height="320" />
            ) : (
              <div class="art-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="art-placeholder__frame"><span>?</span></div>
                <p>ART PENDING<small>正式立绘待补</small></p>
              </div>
            )}
            <PixelIcon name="star" size={18} class="companion-card__spark" />
          </div>

          <div class="companion-card__body">
            <p class="companion-card__en">{c.en}</p>
            <h3>{c.name}</h3>
            <p class="companion-card__role">{c.role}</p>
            <p class="companion-card__setting">{c.setting}</p>

            <div class="dialogue">
              <span class="dialogue__name">{c.name}</span>
              <p class="dialogue__text" data-line>{c.lines[0]}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="companion-card__hint">点击卡片换一句台词 ▸</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="section-note" data-reveal>
      想换正式立绘？把图片放进 <code>public/images/</code>，在 <code>src/data/companions.ts</code> 给对应角色加上 <code>art</code> 路径即可。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
